 "notes": [
  "Twelve-month column of the Q4-2024 release (8-K 2025-02-11).",
  "Visible Alpha acquired May 1, 2024; Fincentric sold Aug 15, 2024; PrimeOne sold in Q4-2024. ES segment zero in 2024 (sold May 2, 2023).",
  "IS \"(Gain) loss on dispositions, net\" printed (59) -> gain_disp +59. \"Other (income) expense, net\" printed (25) -> oth_inc +25.",
  "New in Q4-24: deal-related amortization of 6 is also adjusted in \"Other (income) expense, net\" (Exhibit 5 Adjusted Other (Income) Expense). deal_amort_pre = OP-level deal amortization 1133 + 6 = 1139 (ties to after-tax 861 + tax 278); seg/corp/equity-income deal amortization lines unaffected.",
  "Mobility \"liability write-off\" $1M (after-tax less than $1M) recorded as a benefit (pre -1, net 0), consistent with Q4 (sign not stated in release). The MI liability write-off is described for the three months only.",
  "CORP twelve-month \"net acquisition-related ... cost of $8 million ($8 million after-tax)\" recorded +8.",
  "Executive Leadership Team transition costs (MI $3M, CORP $5M) categorized SEVER per schema.",
  "TAX item (footnote i): tax expense of $6M associated with IHS Markit prior to acquisition (+6). The Q3-24 \"tax reclass of $3 million associated with a disposition\" and Q2-24 $3M tax benefit associated with a business held for sale are not listed for the twelve months.",
  "Item after-tax sum 186 vs printed aggregate 185 (rounding); 3,852 + 185 + 861 = 4,898.",
  "ngaap.items_total_pre = operating-level \"Non-GAAP adjustments\" (245); interest adjustment (premium amortization benefit) printed separately as 26 (adjusted interest 323 vs GAAP 297).",
  "Segment rounding: MI items 45 vs printed 46; Ratings 31 vs 32; CI 29 vs 28; Corporate 120 vs 121.",
  "Non-GAAP adjusted tax line: non-GAAP adjustments 34, deal-related amortization 278. adj_oth_inc = adjusted other (income) expense printed (31) -> +31.",
  "FY2025 guidance is recorded in Q4-24.json."
 ],
